  "hindi": "तुम दूत हो, तुम भी हमारे रक्षक हो; हे वृषभ, तुम बेहतर सौभाग्य की ओर ले जाने वाले नेता हो। हे अग्नि, हमारी सन्तान की, हमारी संतति की, हमारे शरीरों की उपेक्षा न करते हुए, दीप्त होते हुए, रक्षक के रूप में जागरूक रहो।",
  "english": "You are the messenger; you also are our protector; you, O bull, are the leader to better fortune. O Agni, not neglecting, shining, be watchful as guardian of our child, of our offspring, of our selves.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "vasya ā: read vasyaḥ ā 'to the better (thing)'; the case and sense of vasyaḥ are uncertain. tokasya naḥ tane tanūnām: the cases of tokasya, tane and tanūnām and the exact shared construction are uncertain; tane is taken as 'offspring' and tanūnām as 'selves, bodies'. gopāḥ is nominative used in apposition to the subject of bodhi.",
